2000 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: Good morning, David. I was going to wake you up once breakfast\was ready.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2010 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: Those pills work great as usual. I slept like a baby. Where's\everyone?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2020 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: They're on the rooftop with guns, keeping an eye out for\northern tribes' raids. Mr. Lands said we needed to hold the fort until\Greg is back.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2030 GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: I'm sorry to give you all so much trouble... Because of this blood that\flows in my veins, we can't even sit together at the table...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2040 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Susanna: We're all bound to our fate. We sorcerers are simply following\our path. From the moment we were born, we were destined to be\different from normal people.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2050 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6300:BM$="David: So, unless I become the Devil King and defeat the King of the North,\we - Urgh!":GOSUB 5100
2060 GOSUB 9010:GOSUB 6190:BM$="David dropped the coffee cup he was holding. He grasped his chest tight,\and slumped to the floor.":GOSUB 5100:'
2070 BM$="David: Urgh... M-My chest... It feels like... someone's pushing a needle through\it... Agh...!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2080 BM$="Susanna approached David, touching him in order to help him up.":GOSUB 5100
2090 BM$="Susanna: David! What's wrong?! Does your chest hurt?!":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2100 GOSUB 9525:BM$="David: ARGH! D-Don't touch me, it hurts! Someone's pushing... a needle\through my heart... Rgh...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
2110 BM$="Susanna: A needle... It's the King of the North! He's cursing you! David, don't\move! I'll be right back!":GOSUB 5100
2120 POLL X:BM$="Susanna ran down the corridor that led to the basement.":GOSUB 5100
2130 BM$="She returned with four clay dolls and a heavy book.":GOSUB 5100
2140 GOSUB 6200:BM$="Susanna drew a compass on the floor, with David at the center, and placed\the four dolls at each cardinal point. Then, she opened the book, and she\began to chant a spell.":GOSUB 5100
2150 GOSUB 9515:BM$="She was chanting loudly, towards the wall. Had it been night, the Bellmare\comet would be visible in that direction.":GOSUB 5100
2160 BM$="Her forehead was dripping with sweat. Susanna was devoting all of her\strength to create a barrier that would protect David from the King of\the North's spell.":GOSUB 5100
2170 BM$="David was sickly pale, and his eyesight blurry; in his weak state, he did not\react as the South clay figure started glowing red.":GOSUB 5100
2180 GOSUB 6185:ISET X:POLL X:BM$="Susanna's spell came to an end. Her strength spent, she lost\consciousness, collapsing beside David.":GOSUB 5100
2190 BM$="The pain faded from David's chest. Understanding that the spell of the\King of the North had been broken, he reached out for Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
2200 GOSUB 9070:GOSUB 9535:GOSUB 6210:GOSUB 6910:BM$="King Hroth: What are you doing, David?! You must slay the northern tribes!\The star of darkness will leave soon! Why do you hesitate?!":GOSUB 5100
2210 BM$="King Hroth: You have inherited my blood! Do you not crave the power of\the Devil King? Do you wish to succumb to the King of the North?!":GOSUB 5100
2220 BM$="King Hroth: I should not have pinned my hopes on someone unwilling to kill\the men of the North... I must entrust my will to a future generation.":GOSUB 5100
2230 BM$="King Hroth: If the King of the North kills you, he will grow even more\powerful. If you are unwilling to kill the northern tribes, you leave me no\choice - I must kill you myself!":GOSUB 5100
2240 BM$="When David opened his eyes, he saw King Hroth looming over him.":GOSUB 5100
2250 POLL X:GOSUB 9525:BM$="David: AAAHHH!!":GOSUB 5000:GOSUB 5500
2260 GOSUB 6900:COMMON FO:GOSUB 6180:W1=0:GOSUB 6310:BM$="David's body was numb, and he could not move. As if roused by his scream,\Susanna opened her eyes.":GOSUB 5100
